# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The SPA fallback (/* /index.html 200) is deliberately ABSENT: with
# prerendering, every route gets its own dist/<route>/index.html, and the
# fallback loops infinitely against Cloudflare's Pretty URLs feature.
#
# The app itself is hash-routed (#/t1, #/settings) — hashes never hit the
# server, so unknown #/ paths are handled inside the app already.
